@startuml errorHook

box "Integrator/User Responsibility"
    participant "AR-OS"
    participant "ErrorHook / ProtectionHook" as ErrorHook
    note over ErrorHook: ErrorHook shall include //SUM_SOH.h//
end box

box "ETAS Responsibility"
    participant SUM_SOH
end box

activate "AR-OS"
"AR-OS" -> ErrorHook: ErrorHook_CallBack()
destroy "AR-OS"

activate ErrorHook
ErrorHook -> SUM_SOH: //SOH_OS_Protection_ErrorHook_Callback()// 

ErrorHook-->"AR-OS"
deactivate ErrorHook

legend
**legend**: CallBack that are in //italic// are reponsibility of ETAS
end legend
@enduml